WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.061 --> 00:00:08.958
Wukong jumped to his feet and pulled out his iron bar. "Who did that?"

2
00:00:08.959 --> 00:00:16.540
Bippo hid behind Roxy's head. "Scary, him."

3
00:00:16.541 --> 00:00:20.518
Roxy grinned. "Sorry, Wukong!"

4
00:00:20.519 --> 00:00:27.011
Wukong lowered his iron bar. "Rocket Girl! What are you doing here?"

5
00:00:27.012 --> 00:00:31.543
"We need your help." Roxy introduced him to Cozlin.

6
00:00:31.544 --> 00:00:35.312
Bippo peeked out from behind Roxy's head.

7
00:00:35.313 --> 00:00:39.139
"A demon!" Wukong raised his iron bar.

8
00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:41.727
Bippo hid under Roxy's cape.

9
00:00:41.728 --> 00:00:46.790
"No!" Roxy cried. "This is Bippo—he's with us."

10
00:00:46.791 --> 00:00:50.684
Roxy held Bippo out for Wukong to see.

11
00:00:50.685 --> 00:00:53.944
"Scary, you!" Bippo said.

12
00:00:53.945 --> 00:01:00.214
Wukong looked confused. "Is he a spirit?"

13
00:01:00.215 --> 00:01:06.089
Roxy giggled. "Nope. He's a robot."

14
00:01:06.090 --> 00:01:14.941
Cozlin snorted. "Roxy, how is this, um, thing going to help us?"

15
00:01:14.942 --> 00:01:18.788
Wukong frowned. "I'm not a thing.

16
00:01:18.789 --> 00:01:22.116
I'm Sun Wukong, the Monkey King!

17
00:01:22.117 --> 00:01:25.812
I once defeated Heaven's entire army!"

18
00:01:25.813 --> 00:01:30.010
Cozlin held up her hands. "Okay, okay!

19
00:01:30.011 --> 00:01:37.001
We need your help destroying a robot army."

20
00:01:37.002 --> 00:01:40.583
"I'd like to help you," Wukong said.

21
00:01:40.584 --> 00:01:44.324
"But I must find the Tang Monk, Bajie, and Wujing.

22
00:01:44.325 --> 00:01:48.488
I think they were kidnapped by chipmunk demons."

23
00:01:48.489 --> 00:01:54.737
"Chipmunk demons?" Roxy raised an eyebrow.

24
00:01:54.738 --> 00:01:58.073
"Your world is strange, Wukong.

25
00:01:58.074 --> 00:02:02.692
But what if we help you? Then could you help us?"

26
00:02:02.693 --> 00:02:07.841
"Sure," Wukong said. "I was saying earlier that I was bored.

27
00:02:07.842 --> 00:02:10.157
Today is turning out to be exciting.

28
00:02:10.158 --> 00:02:13.240
We just need to figure out where the demons are.

29
00:02:13.241 --> 00:02:18.827
Demons usually live on mountains, but there aren't any mountains here."

30
00:02:18.828 --> 00:02:23.715
He flew up into the air.

31
00:02:23.716 --> 00:02:31.906
In the distance he saw a dark cloud near a wide river. "Aha! Demons!"

32
00:02:31.907 --> 00:02:37.282
He led Roxy and Cozlin to the spot and found a cave in the bank of the river.

33
00:02:37.283 --> 00:02:41.035
The cave's entrance was blocked by a heavy-looking door.

34
00:02:41.036 --> 00:02:46.065
Creepy twisted trees stood tall along the river.

35
00:02:46.066 --> 00:02:50.286
"This place is spooky," Roxy said.

36
00:02:50.287 --> 00:02:54.959
Wukong waved a hand. "Trees can't hurt you."

37
00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:59.531
He took out his iron bar and smashed the door.

38
00:02:59.532 --> 00:03:01.363
"Release my friends right now.

39
00:03:01.364 --> 00:03:06.994
Or I'll smash this entire cave and destroy every single one of you!"

40
00:03:06.995 --> 00:03:10.168
The chipmunk demons hurried out.

41
00:03:10.169 --> 00:03:14.447
"How dare you yell at us!" one of them said.

42
00:03:14.448 --> 00:03:18.574
"Look at this," another one said, pointing to the broken door.

43
00:03:18.575 --> 00:03:21.367
"He smashed our door!"

44
00:03:21.368 --> 00:03:26.221
"That is so rude," the third chipmunk demon said.

45
00:03:26.222 --> 00:03:29.009
Roxy tried not to laugh.

46
00:03:29.010 --> 00:03:35.990
"These are demons, Wukong? They look kind of cute."

47
00:03:35.991 --> 00:03:40.901
"Grr!" The chipmunk demons attacked.

48
00:03:40.902 --> 00:03:45.543
"Ahh!" Roxy swatted one demon with her hand.

49
00:03:45.544 --> 00:03:52.212
Poof! The demon turned into a regular chipmunk, which scurried away into the forest.

50
00:03:52.213 --> 00:03:55.128
Cozlin hit a second demon with a laser blast.

51
00:03:55.129 --> 00:04:00.106
Poof! It also turned into a regular chipmunk and scurried away.

52
00:04:00.107 --> 00:04:05.129
The third demon took a step back as Wukong raised his iron bar.

53
00:04:05.130 --> 00:04:08.857
"You should all leave," the demon said.

54
00:04:08.858 --> 00:04:13.848
"Our boss is going to be very angry with you!"

55
00:04:13.849 --> 00:04:21.699
Wukong laughed. "I'm not afraid of chipmunks!"

56
00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:27.132
"He's not a chipmunk," the demon said. "He's bigger."

57
00:04:27.133 --> 00:04:35.979
Wukong laughed again. "Oh, really? What type of demon is he? A squirrel demon?"

58
00:04:35.980 --> 00:04:40.509
Just then thick branches grabbed Wukong, Roxy, and Cozlin.

59
00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:47.370
"I'm the Demon of Mighty Roots," a deep voice said.

60
00:04:47.371 --> 00:04:57.514
"I'm going to eat the Tang Monk and live forever!"

